{%- comment -%}
==============================================================================
  IRONCLAD FIGHT CO. — HOMEPAGE (single Custom Liquid paste)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Kaise lagayein:
  1. Shopify Admin > Online Store > Themes > Customize
  2. Home page par "Add section" > "Custom Liquid"
  3. Is poori file ka content copy karke us box mein paste karein > Save
  4. Neeche "EDIT YAHAN" wale hisse mein text / images / collection handles
     apne hisaab se badal lein.
  Note: apne theme ka default header/footer chalta rahega. Agar aap chahte hain
  ke sirf yeh design dikhe, to theme editor mein baaki sections remove kar dein.
==============================================================================
{%- endcomment -%}

